Subject: [PATCH] appstream: use host appstreamcli for cross build

The cross build only needs appstreamcli as a native helper for generating
AppStream's own metainfo. Do not require a native appstream version matching
the target source, and do not override find_program() to point at the
target-built iOS binary.

diff -ruN -U0 --exclude=*.bak a/data/meson.build b/data/meson.build
--- a/data/meson.build	2024-04-24 11:03:56
+++ b/data/meson.build	2026-07-05 00:24:26
@@ -12,2 +11,0 @@
-    dependency('appstream', version: '>=' + as_version, native: true,
-               not_found_message: 'Native appstream required for cross-building')
diff -ruN -U0 --exclude=*.bak a/tools/meson.build b/tools/meson.build
--- a/tools/meson.build	2024-04-24 11:03:56
+++ b/tools/meson.build	2026-07-05 00:24:26
@@ -20 +19,0 @@
-meson.override_find_program('appstreamcli', ascli_exe)
